// Brush size for every brush item, by keys and wheel, as the game reads them (view::BrushSizes):
// `]` grows and `[` shrinks by the character typed (so Option+8 / Option+9 on a Swedish Mac work too),
// Option/Alt + wheel resizes, while Shift (sprint) + wheel and Ctrl/Cmd + wheel (zoom) leave it alone.
// Sizes clamp to the item's range, and a bigger pickaxe brush digs a bigger bite.
map
#########################################
#.............ddddddddddddddddddddddddd###
#.............ddddddddddddddddddddddddd###
#.............ddddddddddddddddddddddddd###
#.............ddddddddddddddddddddddddd###
#.............ddddddddddddddddddddddddd###
#.............ddddddddddddddddddddddddd###
#.............ddddddddddddddddddddddddd###
#.....@.......ddddddddddddddddddddddddd###
#########################################
end
hand 1 Pickaxe
expect 2 brush == 2.5
sizekey 3 ]
expect 4 brush == 3
sizekey 5 ]
expect 6 brush == 3          // the pickaxe's largest bite
sizekey 7 [
sizekey 8 [
sizekey 9 [
sizekey 10 [
sizekey 11 [
sizekey 12 [
expect 13 brush == 0.5       // its smallest
sizewheel 14 alt 2
expect 15 brush == 1.5
sizewheel 16 shift 3
sizewheel 17 ctrl 3
sizewheel 18 cmd 3
expect 19 brush == 1.5       // sprint and zoom don't touch the brush
// a small bite, then a big one: the big one takes much more dirt
mine 20-40 10 -4
expect 41 count:Dirt >= 189       // 200 dirt tiles; the small bite takes about 7
expect 41 count:Dirt <= 196
sizekey 42 ]
sizekey 43 ]
sizekey 44 ]
expect 45 brush == 3
mine 46-70 16 -4
expect 71 count:Dirt <= 176       // the big bite takes about 27 more
// a block brush has its own size
hand 72 WoodPillar
expect 73 brush == 0.5
sizekey 74 ]
expect 75 brush == 1
hand 76 Pickaxe
expect 77 brush == 3         // the pickaxe kept its own
